  {
    "RowOffset": 695706,
    "RowId": 38300,
    "Text": "Arrive at Friendship Round"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 695746,
    "RowId": 38301,
    "Text": "Defeat His Royal Headness Leonogg I"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 695794,
    "RowId": 38302,
    "Text": "Arrive at the Party Plaza"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 695830,
    "RowId": 38303,
    "Text": "Defeat Jack-in-the-Pot"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 695866,
    "RowId": 38304,
    "Text": "Arrive at the Restive Hall"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 695906,
    "RowId": 38305,
    "Text": "Defeat Träumerei"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 695934,
    "RowId": 38306,
    "Text": "Bow down to my flawless noggin─your king decrees it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696002,
    "RowId": 38307,
    "Text": "Join us, and be crowned in splendor!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696050,
    "RowId": 38308,
    "Text": "I-Impossible! You would deny my regal, royal headness!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696118,
    "RowId": 38309,
    "Text": "Behold! Your noggin is made new!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696162,
    "RowId": 38310,
    "Text": "Little lords! Little ladies! Let us proffer our heads in friendship!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696242,
    "RowId": 38311,
    "Text": "Open your mind, and let us bestow upon you a glorious noggin..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696318,
    "RowId": 38312,
    "Text": "I-Inconceivable! Why must you refuse our companionship!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696386,
    "RowId": 38313,
    "Text": "A most splendid noggin! You are worthy of my court!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696450,
    "RowId": 38314,
    "Text": "Oh, little lords and ladies...your king has need of you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696518,
    "RowId": 38315,
    "Text": "All shall be blessed with nogginhood!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696566,
    "RowId": 38316,
    "Text": "You dare defy my royal decree!? Have you no sense!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696630,
    "RowId": 38317,
    "Text": "Grrr... I can tolerate your unsightly pate no longer! Off with your head! Off with it, I say!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696734,
    "RowId": 38318,
    "Text": "One among you has refused nogginhood..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696786,
    "RowId": 38319,
    "Text": "A pristine noggin indeed... But you mustn't let its beauty go to your head! Ohoho!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696882,
    "RowId": 38320,
    "Text": "I shall not rest until my every subject bears a beauteous noggin!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 696958,
    "RowId": 38321,
    "Text": "Cleanse the unsightly one! There is no escaping our brilliance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697034,
    "RowId": 38322,
    "Text": "Ah, yes... A glorious, noddling noodle, as befits my kingdom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697106,
    "RowId": 38323,
    "Text": "Apologies for breaking character, but...perhaps it's time you stopped resisting? There are limits to my patience."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697230,
    "RowId": 38324,
    "Text": "...How many times must I tell you to stand still? Nogginhood doesn't hurt! I swear it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697330,
    "RowId": 38325,
    "Text": "\\\\<sob> Please, just...let me kill you! LET ME KILL YOU!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697398,
    "RowId": 38326,
    "Text": "Greetings, goodly guests! Your tea awaits!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697454,
    "RowId": 38327,
    "Text": "I've not had company in ages... This calls for my finest cups!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697530,
    "RowId": 38328,
    "Text": "Cheers! A frightful toast to you and yours!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697586,
    "RowId": 38329,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697598,
    "RowId": 38330,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697610,
    "RowId": 38331,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697622,
    "RowId": 38332,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697634,
    "RowId": 38333,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697646,
    "RowId": 38334,
    "Text": "Round and round, the cups shall go!\nWhere they stop? Why, no one knows!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697734,
    "RowId": 38335,
    "Text": "Drink all you like─I guarantee my brew is to die for!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697802,
    "RowId": 38336,
    "Text": "Good-bye, my subjects...and good night..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697854,
    "RowId": 38337,
    "Text": "'Tis our duty to seize the nogginless!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 697906,
    "RowId": 38338,
    "Text": "Yesterday is gone, yet tomorrow never comes... So sleep, child, and drown in nightmares everlasting."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698018,
    "RowId": 38339,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698030,
    "RowId": 38340,
    "Text": "Defy me as you wish. It will not wake you from this misery."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698102,
    "RowId": 38341,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698114,
    "RowId": 38342,
    "Text": "I see it shall take more than honeyed words to lull you to your eternal sleep..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698206,
    "RowId": 38343,
    "Text": "Spirits of eternal reverie, to me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698254,
    "RowId": 38344,
    "Text": "Allow me to offer my aid! Step into the light, and become as a ghost to pass through all things corporeal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698374,
    "RowId": 38345,
    "Text": "But ware Träumerei's magicks... Should you sense danger, return to my beacons, and your mortal flesh shall be restored!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698506,
    "RowId": 38346,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698518,
    "RowId": 38347,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698530,
    "RowId": 38348,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698542,
    "RowId": 38349,
    "Text": "Welcome one and all to the land of waking dreams <i>and</i> nightmares! Please form a single-file line as you enter."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698674,
    "RowId": 38350,
    "Text": "A word to our guests: Strayborough is open for all eternity! Answer your heart's every desire, and dream your days─or your life─away!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698822,
    "RowId": 38351,
    "Text": "Hear ye, hear ye! His Royal Headness Leonogg I graces us with his presence!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 698910,
    "RowId": 38352,
    "Text": "Lost souls of every age, the Frolicking Grounds is your whimsical stage! Do be careful not to lose yourself in our phantasmal attractions!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699062,
    "RowId": 38353,
    "Text": "Attention, all dreamers─you are cordially invited to Jack-in-the-Pot's enchanted tea party!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699166,
    "RowId": 38354,
    "Text": "You have entered the Endless House... Fear not, for I shall guide you through its haunted halls."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699274,
    "RowId": 38355,
    "Text": "You are a formidable slayer of ghosts...but have you the strength to best their master?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699374,
    "RowId": 38356,
    "Text": "Beyond this hall lies Träumerei, Lord of Nightmares."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699438,
    "RowId": 38357,
    "Text": "Heed my words, and together, we shall end his reign of terror!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699514,
    "RowId": 38358,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 699526,
    "RowId": 38359,
    "Text": ""
  },
