  {
    "RowOffset": 702394,
    "RowId": 38600,
    "Text": "Arrive in Unsung Elegy"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702430,
    "RowId": 38601,
    "Text": "Clear Unsung Elegy"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702462,
    "RowId": 38602,
    "Text": "Arrive on Vurgar Mettlegrounds"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702506,
    "RowId": 38603,
    "Text": "Clear Vurgar Mettlegrounds"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702546,
    "RowId": 38604,
    "Text": "Arrive on Gatekeep's Anvil"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702586,
    "RowId": 38605,
    "Text": "Defeat Maulskull"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702614,
    "RowId": 38606,
    "Text": "Rats... There are rats!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702650,
    "RowId": 38607,
    "Text": "Workers, arise! Eliminate the rats!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702698,
    "RowId": 38608,
    "Text": "Smash them! Smear them into pulp!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702742,
    "RowId": 38609,
    "Text": "Silence... Our workers have fallen... Activate Firearms!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702810,
    "RowId": 38610,
    "Text": "Core engaged... Firearms is risen!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702858,
    "RowId": 38611,
    "Text": "Hahaha, such power! Destroy, destroy, destroy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702918,
    "RowId": 38612,
    "Text": "By enchanted sledge, intruders begone! Begone, begone, begone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 702994,
    "RowId": 38613,
    "Text": "Burn upon the mettlegrounds! Burn, burn, burn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703054,
    "RowId": 38614,
    "Text": "Crumble beneath my full might! Die, die, die!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703110,
    "RowId": 38615,
    "Text": "Pursue Apyaahi"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703138,
    "RowId": 38616,
    "Text": "Aid your allies"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703166,
    "RowId": 38617,
    "Text": "Aid your allies"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703194,
    "RowId": 38618,
    "Text": "Defeat the mycotender"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703226,
    "RowId": 38619,
    "Text": "Repel the mycotender's attack"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703266,
    "RowId": 38620,
    "Text": "Defeat Apyaahi"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703294,
    "RowId": 38621,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703306,
    "RowId": 38622,
    "Text": "We have to take care of these beasts before going after Apyaahi!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703382,
    "RowId": 38623,
    "Text": "Over here, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703422,
    "RowId": 38624,
    "Text": "I need help over here!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703458,
    "RowId": 38625,
    "Text": "As I feared... My creatures cannot live up to the real thing."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703530,
    "RowId": 38626,
    "Text": "How about this?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703558,
    "RowId": 38627,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703570,
    "RowId": 38628,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703582,
    "RowId": 38629,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703594,
    "RowId": 38630,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703606,
    "RowId": 38631,
    "Text": "A tenacious lot, aren't you? Well, I suppose I wouldn't want you to fall too quickly."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703702,
    "RowId": 38632,
    "Text": "There are so many...but we will persevere!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703758,
    "RowId": 38633,
    "Text": "I can smother them in flames. Lend me your protection!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703826,
    "RowId": 38634,
    "Text": "Scheming, are we? Don't think I'll allow you to do as you please."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703902,
    "RowId": 38635,
    "Text": "No! My poor, pitiful pets!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 703942,
    "RowId": 38636,
    "Text": "So I cannot rely on numbers alone... Keep them distracted, my darlings!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704026,
    "RowId": 38637,
    "Text": "We'll be fine. Go after Apyaahi!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704070,
    "RowId": 38638,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704082,
    "RowId": 38639,
    "Text": "I might be in trouble..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704118,
    "RowId": 38640,
    "Text": "Something a little different this time. Behold the fruits of my travels across Tural."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704214,
    "RowId": 38641,
    "Text": "Thanks for the help! Now to catch Apyaahi!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704270,
    "RowId": 38642,
    "Text": "Don't think you've won yet."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704310,
    "RowId": 38643,
    "Text": "You're strong, to be sure. But so is <i>this</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704374,
    "RowId": 38644,
    "Text": "Send your worst─I won't lose!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704418,
    "RowId": 38645,
    "Text": "Don't hold back! My medicines will keep you upright!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704482,
    "RowId": 38646,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704494,
    "RowId": 38647,
    "Text": "Limits are just more rules to be broken!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704546,
    "RowId": 38648,
    "Text": "That doesn't look good..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704582,
    "RowId": 38649,
    "Text": "Worry not. Get behind me, and you'll be safe!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704638,
    "RowId": 38650,
    "Text": "You...you survived that!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704674,
    "RowId": 38651,
    "Text": "Bah, even bugs squirm before they die. This time I'll finish things!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704754,
    "RowId": 38652,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704766,
    "RowId": 38653,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704778,
    "RowId": 38654,
    "Text": "You're as stubborn as the mud stuck to my sandals... Yet that alone is not enough to─ What?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704882,
    "RowId": 38655,
    "Text": "Something's gotten into them..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704926,
    "RowId": 38656,
    "Text": "I admit... I may have underestimated you lot."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 704982,
    "RowId": 38657,
    "Text": "And while defeating you would be quite the feather in my cap, the gates of Tuliyollal are a much easier target..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705106,
    "RowId": 38658,
    "Text": "Curses, she's making a run for it! Follow her, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705182,
    "RowId": 38659,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705194,
    "RowId": 38660,
    "Text": "Anything that would obstruct the free world I aim to create will be destroyed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705286,
    "RowId": 38661,
    "Text": "Go forth, my prickly punisher, and crush those who would bind us!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705362,
    "RowId": 38662,
    "Text": "...My, but what is this sudden, dreadful feeling...? Perhaps I haven't been sleeping well as of late."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705474,
    "RowId": 38663,
    "Text": "Impressive. I expected no less of you. But this farce ends here!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705550,
    "RowId": 38664,
    "Text": "Now, smash <If(PlayerParameter(4))>her<Else/>him</If> to a pulp!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705602,
    "RowId": 38665,
    "Text": "I don't think so!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705630,
    "RowId": 38666,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705642,
    "RowId": 38667,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705654,
    "RowId": 38668,
    "Text": "So you find comfort in fellowship. At least this will save me the trouble of killing you one by one."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705766,
    "RowId": 38669,
    "Text": "This is your moment, my pointy pugilist!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705818,
    "RowId": 38670,
    "Text": "Ungh... It's getting even stronger!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705866,
    "RowId": 38671,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705878,
    "RowId": 38672,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, we are at your back! Together we'll repel this foul creature!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 705970,
    "RowId": 38673,
    "Text": "Keep going, everyone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706002,
    "RowId": 38674,
    "Text": "How...how can you stand before the treasure's might!? What are you!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706082,
    "RowId": 38675,
    "Text": "Such power...power that would be welcome within the Passage of the Unbound!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706170,
    "RowId": 38676,
    "Text": "Victory is mine! Now do you know the beauty of true freedom!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706242,
    "RowId": 38677,
    "Text": "Do not falter, my spiky soldier!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706286,
    "RowId": 38678,
    "Text": "Gather around <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, everyone!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706338,
    "RowId": 38679,
    "Text": "Can you withstand this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706374,
    "RowId": 38680,
    "Text": "Spread out, or we'll be swept away!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706422,
    "RowId": 38681,
    "Text": "You scurry about like rats! Pulverize them with this, my barbed barbarian!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706510,
    "RowId": 38682,
    "Text": "Is this...poison? Stay away from it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706558,
    "RowId": 38683,
    "Text": "No... Even my spiny savior has fallen..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706610,
    "RowId": 38684,
    "Text": "Grrr! I'm not finished yet! I can replenish my ranks!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706674,
    "RowId": 38685,
    "Text": "Crush them underfoot!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706706,
    "RowId": 38686,
    "Text": "I'll end this in a single blow!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706750,
    "RowId": 38687,
    "Text": "Attacking from above!? Devious..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706794,
    "RowId": 38688,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706806,
    "RowId": 38689,
    "Text": "Leave the skies to me. The rest of you, focus on the big one!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706878,
    "RowId": 38690,
    "Text": "No, I think not."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706906,
    "RowId": 38691,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 706918,
    "RowId": 38692,
    "Text": ""
  },
