    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707262,
    "RowId": 38710,
    "Text": "To the memories of better days, I bid farewell..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707322,
    "RowId": 38711,
    "Text": "Have you heard? Princess Sphene is here!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707374,
    "RowId": 38712,
    "Text": "Foreign entities detected. Proceeding with removal."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707438,
    "RowId": 38713,
    "Text": "Your smile means all is right with the world."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707494,
    "RowId": 38714,
    "Text": "If I smile, it is because you all smile for me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707554,
    "RowId": 38715,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707566,
    "RowId": 38716,
    "Text": "Foreign entities remain. Initiating level three security protocol."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707646,
    "RowId": 38717,
    "Text": "Initiating security protocol. "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707690,
    "RowId": 38718,
    "Text": "You are my people, and I will protect you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707746,
    "RowId": 38719,
    "Text": "The painful memories of war, I lay to rest..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707802,
    "RowId": 38720,
    "Text": "Quickly, take shelter in the castle!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707850,
    "RowId": 38721,
    "Text": "Foreign entities detected. Proceeding with removal."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707914,
    "RowId": 38722,
    "Text": "Is anyone still out here?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 707950,
    "RowId": 38723,
    "Text": "There are people over there! Bring us closer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708006,
    "RowId": 38724,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708018,
    "RowId": 38725,
    "Text": "It's too dangerous! You must flee!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708066,
    "RowId": 38726,
    "Text": "Don't worry about me! Just save yourself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708118,
    "RowId": 38727,
    "Text": "May we meet again, Your Highness!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708162,
    "RowId": 38728,
    "Text": "Security breach confirmed. Initiating level five security protocol."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708242,
    "RowId": 38729,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708254,
    "RowId": 38730,
    "Text": "Fear not. You will all live on."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708298,
    "RowId": 38731,
    "Text": "And at the last, my final...\\\\<bzzzt>...an Endless..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708362,
    "RowId": 38732,
    "Text": "Foreign enti...detected. Initiating...rity protocol."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708426,
    "RowId": 38733,
    "Text": "They've done it! They've preserved the queen's..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708486,
    "RowId": 38734,
    "Text": "We can't give up! Not until...keep...complete..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 708546,
    "RowId": 38735,
    "Text": "Foreign entities...prior to comp...memory erasure."
  },
  {
